    "A10, Euclid's axiom", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "365010ac-cd5f-4255-bfa7-23650993d1ff"], Cell["\<\
The Euclidean axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e218329b-ae2a-4ca4-94cd-cd2ce16557b6"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"4678b660-bf4b-4ebe-a241-\
